---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Terms of Use — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="Terms of Use for Roadbook of Cycling."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main class="legal-main">
			<div class="container">
				<header class="legal-head">
					<p class="label legal-kicker">Legal</p>
					<h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
					<p class="legal-sub">Last updated: February 2026</p>
				</header>

				<article class="prose legal-prose">

					<p>
						Please read these Terms of Use ("Terms") carefully before using
						<a href="https://www.roadbookofcycling.com">www.roadbookofcycling.com</a>
						(the "Site"), operated by Gareth Winter ("we", "us", or "our").
						By accessing or using the Site, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
						If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use the Site.
					</p>

					<h2>1. Use of the Site</h2>

					<p>
						This Site is provided for personal, non-commercial informational purposes. You agree to use
						the Site only for lawful purposes and in a manner that does not infringe the rights of others
						or restrict or inhibit their use and enjoyment of the Site.
					</p>
					<p>You must not:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable local, national, or international law or regulation</li>
						<li>Reproduce, duplicate, copy, or re-sell any part of the Site without express written permission</li>
						<li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the Site or its related systems</li>
						<li>Transmit any unsolicited or unauthorised advertising or promotional material</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>2. Intellectual Property</h2>

					<p>
						All content on this Site — including but not limited to text, photography, graphics, logos,
						and editorial copy — is the property of Gareth Winter and is protected by applicable
						copyright and intellectual property law. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any
						content from this Site without prior written permission.
					</p>
					<p>
						Where third-party content appears (such as embedded videos or brand logos displayed for
						editorial reference), all rights remain with the respective rights holders.
					</p>

					<h2>3. Accuracy of Information</h2>

					<p>
						The content on this Site is published for general informational and editorial purposes.
						While we take care to ensure accuracy, we make no warranty — express or implied — as to
						the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or suitability of the information. Any reliance
						you place on such information is strictly at your own risk.
					</p>
					<p>
						Product reviews, training advice, and gear recommendations reflect personal opinion and
						experience. They are not a substitute for professional advice. Always consult a qualified
						professional before making decisions about training, nutrition, or equipment.
					</p>

					<h2>4. Affiliate Links and Advertising</h2>

					<p>
						This Site may contain affiliate links and display advertising through Google AdSense.
						Where a link may earn a commission, this will be disclosed clearly. Affiliate relationships
						do not influence editorial content — our reviews and recommendations reflect genuine
						personal experience and opinion only.
					</p>

					<h2>5. Third-Party Links</h2>

					<p>
						The Site may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for your
						convenience only. We have no control over the content of those sites and accept no
						responsibility for them or for any loss or damage that may arise from your use of them.
					</p>

					<h2>6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>

					<p>
						The Site is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without any warranties of
						any kind, either express or implied. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted,
						error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.
					</p>

					<h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>

					<p>
						To the fullest extent permitted by law, Gareth Winter shall not be liable for any indirect,
						incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or in connection with your
						use of the Site or its content.
					</p>

					<h2>8. Comments and User Submissions</h2>

					<p>
						By submitting a message via our contact form, you grant us the right to use the content
						of that message for the purpose of responding to your enquiry. We will not publish or
						share your personal communications without your permission.
					</p>

					<h2>9. Changes to These Terms</h2>

					<p>
						We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this
						page with an updated date. Your continued use of the Site after any changes constitutes
						your acceptance of the revised Terms.
					</p>

					<h2>10. Governing Law</h2>

					<p>
						These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of England and Wales.
						Any disputes arising in connection with these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive
						jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
					</p>

					<h2>11. Contact</h2>

					<p>
						If you have any questions about these Terms, please get in touch via the
						<a href="/about">contact form on our About page</a>.
					</p>

				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.legal-main {
		padding-top: var(--s-9);
		padding-bottom: var(--s-10);
	}

	.legal-head {
		max-width: var(--measure);
		margin: 0 auto var(--s-8);
	}

	.legal-kicker {
		margin-bottom: var(--s-4);
	}

	.legal-title {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, var(--text-4xl));
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.05;
		margin: 0 0 var(--s-3);
	}

	.legal-sub {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--muted);
		margin: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
	}

	.legal-prose {
		max-width: var(--measure);
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
</style>
